{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/694786-who-is-god45","id":694786,"title":"Who is God45?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-09T06:25:10-07:00","id":694786,"title":"Who is God45?","content":"I know he's a member of the bad guy/team killing psycho Creed from Wayward, but his page on the wiki is home dry.<br /> <br /> Any help?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-09T07:11:07-07:00","id":694879,"title":"","content":"A former medical technician who worked preparing slides for his hospital's oncology department. Out of the blue one day, the Messengers showed him that his son looked wrong, and so he killed him; his wife did not, but resisted this course of action, so he killed her, too, starting his streak of seeing humans who help monsters as being tainted by association. He sees monsters as cancer, and anyone who helps as being a terminal case, but any hunter that's willing to pull out all of the stops and let no scruples stop them is at least &quot;on the right track&quot; in his book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/